    "intro_narrative": "Welcome to the Clockwork Citadel, the abandoned workshop of the legendary inventor, Lord Archibald. The air is thick with the scent of oil and ozone, and the constant hiss of steam pipes echoes through the cavernous room. Your objective is to secure the Grand Master Key, a legendary artifact containing the ultimate cryptographic sequence that can shut down the rogue automaton army threatening the city. The key is hidden deep within a web of mechanical puzzles, steam-powered terminals, and brass contraptions. To succeed, you must navigate through a series of interlocking mechanisms, each relying on the output of another to function. Time is ticking, and the boiler pressure is rising dangerously high. Will you decipher the logic of the Clockwork Citadel before the automatons breach the city gates?",
    "narrative_style": "steampunk"
  },
